        <Text>
          <style>Title</style>
          <text>Audio compatibility D - Parameters and portamento</text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
          <style>Subtitle</style>
          <text>Same SoundFont and dry effects in both backends. Notes D1-D5 are all written A4.
Expected sound: A4, A5, A4, E5, A4. D6 glides C4 to C5 in 512 ms; D7 is straight C5.</text>
        </Text>
